Fuzz: box rad 8px wid 1.7 ht 0.56 "Fuzz band"
Region: box rad 8px wid 1.7 ht 0.56 "Region checks" at Fuzz + (0, -0.8)
Semantic: box rad 8px wid 1.7 ht 0.56 "Semantic checks" at Region + (0, -0.8)
Verdict: box rad 8px wid 1.7 ht 0.56 "One verdict" at Region + (4.8, 0)
arrow from Fuzz.e to Verdict.w "whole image"
arrow from Region.e to Verdict.w "ink and SSIM"
arrow from Semantic.e to Verdict.w "text and pages"
